  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> be the focal chord of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x.</mi></math>&nbsp;If the centre of the circle having <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> as its diameter lies on the line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the length (in units) of chord <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> is"
  },
