  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> then <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />mid point of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7.2</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7.2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7.2</mn></math><br />{ <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> }"
